      "versionNonce": 2074963698,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795195153827,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "When we apply a index??\n\n        -> Faster Read\n        -> Slower write\n                    (when you update a DB\n                     You also update a index)\n        -> Storage problem (where you can store)\n\n\n\nif your DB are large then you can make a index",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "When we apply a index??\n\n        -> Faster Read\n        -> Slower write\n                    (when you update a DB\n                     You also update a index)\n        -> Storage problem (where you can store)\n\n\n\nif your DB are large then you can make a index",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
